### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

###

### Create check
POST http://localhost:3000/health
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Azlan",
    "userId": "u4",
    "type": "document",
    "status": "pending",
    "score": null
}

###

### Get check by ID (c1 - complete)
GET http://localhost:3000/health/c1

###

### Get check by ID (c2 - pending)
GET http://localhost:3000/health/c2

###

### Get check by ID (c4 - failed)
GET http://localhost:3000/health/c4

###

### Get check by ID (non-existing)
GET http://localhost:3000/health/c99

###

### Get all checks
GET http://localhost:3000/checks

###

### Get pending checks
GET http://localhost:3000/checks?status=pending

###

### Get complete checks
GET http://localhost:3000/checks?status=complete

###

### Get failed checks
GET http://localhost:3000/checks?status=failed
